# ===========================================================================
# Genpei Kassen RE — repository ignore rules
#
# Only the DOS reverse-engineering target is tracked:
#     include/                          engine headers
#     src/                              engine sources
#     tools/                            asset extraction tooling (Python)
#     third_party/                      vendored SDL2 headers + libSDL2.so
#     games/yphz/                       original DOS game data (PC-98)
#     Plugins/{koei,Big5,GBK}.txt       encoding / code tables
#     Makefile, CMakeLists.txt          build entry points
#
# Everything below is the Windows/DOSBox repack "shell", derived outputs or
# build noise and is intentionally NOT part of the repository.
# ===========================================================================

# --- Build artifacts -------------------------------------------------------
*.o
*.a
*.d
build/
bin/
/tmp/
*.pyc
__pycache__/

# --- Runtime noise ---------------------------------------------------------
*.log
stderr.txt
stdout.txt

